      "description": "Filled rubber card, no border, no shadow; session shape as a category strip.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-title\">Upper Body Power</div><div class=\"ds-card-meta\">4 exercises &middot; ~30 min</div><div class=\"ds-strip\"><span style=\"flex:4;background:#D2232A\"></span><span style=\"flex:4;background:#1E5BC6\"></span><span style=\"flex:3;background:#1E5BC6\"></span><span style=\"flex:3;background:#D2232A\"></span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{background:#1D1F21;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;max-width:360px}.ds-card-title{font-family:'Big Shoulders Display',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;line-height:42px;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:#F2F1EC}.ds-card-meta{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#C9C9C3;margin-top:4px}.ds-strip{display:flex;gap:3px;height:10px;margin-top:16px}.ds-strip span{border-radius:2px}"
